1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,554
Bugungi videoda quvonch, qaygʻu, gʻazab va his-tuygʻular bor. Koʻrmasangiz, jahli chiqadi!

2
00:00:10,554 --> 00:00:18,576
Videoning qayeridurida yapon tilida savol chiqadi. Eshitsangiz, izoh qoldiring.

3
00:00:19,196 --> 00:00:22,656
1-qism: Soyabonni yoʻqotish va nima qilish kerak / Sevimli soyabonni yoʻqotish va chora koʻrish

4
00:00:23,015 --> 00:00:26,215
Voy, nima qilsam?

5
00:00:26,237 --> 00:00:28,478
Nima boʻldi?

6
00:00:28,502 --> 00:00:32,553
Sevimli soyabonimni yoʻqotib qoʻydim.

7
00:00:32,577 --> 00:00:36,177
A, shu koʻk soyabonmi?

8
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,400
Ha, aynan shu soyabon.

9
00:00:39,423 --> 00:00:42,028
Qayerda yoʻqotdingiz?

10
00:00:42,051 --> 00:00:45,107
Ehtimol, poyezdda.

11
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:48,663
Poyezd kompaniyasiga qoʻngʻiroq qildingizmi?

12
00:00:48,686 --> 00:00:51,863
Yoʻq, hali qilmadim.

13
00:00:51,887 --> 00:00:55,464
Darhol qoʻngʻiroq qilsangiz yaxshi boʻlardi.

14
00:00:55,487 --> 00:00:59,061
Lekin topilmaydi deb oʻylayman.

15
00:00:59,084 --> 00:01:02,451
Bunday emas.

16
00:01:02,474 --> 00:01:06,330
Bu soyabon menga juda qadrli edi.

17
00:01:06,353 --> 00:01:08,828
Qayerdan sotib olgansiz?

18
00:01:08,852 --> 00:01:13,335
Oʻtgan yili tugʻilgan kunimda opam sovgʻa qilgan edi.

19
00:01:13,359 --> 00:01:16,218
Bu juda achinarli.

20
00:01:16,241 --> 00:01:19,857
Ha, juda shokda boʻldim.

21
00:01:19,881 --> 00:01:23,147
Tashvishlanmang, qoʻngʻiroq qiling.

22
00:01:23,170 --> 00:01:26,857
Telefon raqamini bilmayman.

23
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:30,520
Men hozir smartfonimdan qidirib topaman.

24
00:01:30,544 --> 00:01:32,211
Rahmat.

25
00:01:32,234 --> 00:01:36,167
A, raqam topildi.

26
00:01:36,190 --> 00:01:37,757
Rostdanmi?

27
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:41,079
Ha, shu raqamga qoʻngʻiroq qiling.

28
00:01:41,103 --> 00:01:44,169
Biroz asabim qaltirayapti.

29
00:01:44,192 --> 00:01:48,088
Hech qisi yoq, hech qisi yoq.

30
00:01:48,111 --> 00:01:51,925
Agar topilmasa, nima qilaman?

31
00:01:51,949 --> 00:01:56,982
Oʻshanda yangi soyabonni birga sotib olamiz.

32
00:01:57,006 --> 00:02:01,406
Men sizga juda chiroyli soyabon sovgʻa qilaman.

33
00:02:01,429 --> 00:02:03,401
Rostdanmi?

34
00:02:03,424 --> 00:02:07,258
Xoʻsh, shuning uchun ham ruhiyatingizni koʻtarib turing.

35
00:02:07,281 --> 00:02:08,922
Rahmat.

36
00:02:08,945 --> 00:02:11,800
Biroz ruhiyatim koʻtarildi.

37
00:02:11,823 --> 00:02:15,423
Yaxshi, avvalo qoʻngʻiroq qilamiz.

38
00:02:15,446 --> 00:02:18,646
Ha, qoʻngʻiroq qilib koʻrayapman.

39
00:02:18,669 --> 00:02:25,774
Bugungi videoni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif qismida va eng yuqori izohda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

40
00:02:25,774 --> 00:02:28,774
2-qism: Ajablantiruvchi uchrashuv / Hayratlanarli uchrashuv

41
00:02:28,774 --> 00:02:33,341
E, bu holda, Ken-san emasmisiz?

42
00:02:33,364 --> 00:02:35,062
E?

43
00:02:35,085 --> 00:02:38,732
Ha, menman.

44
00:02:38,756 --> 00:02:42,289
Menman. Hana.

45
00:02:42,312 --> 00:02:46,081
Eee! Hana-sansizmi?

46
00:02:46,105 --> 00:02:50,777
Ha. Rostdan ham uzoq vaqt boʻldi.

47
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:53,266
Juda hayron boʻldim.

48
00:02:53,289 --> 00:02:56,549
Rostdan ham Hana-sansiz.

49
00:02:56,572 --> 00:03:02,139
Ha. Taxminan oʻn yil boʻldi.

50
00:03:02,162 --> 00:03:05,729
Nega shu yerda turibsiz?

51
00:03:05,752 --> 00:03:09,352
Bugun xarid qilish uchun keldim.

52
00:03:09,375 --> 00:03:14,142
Mana. Men bu yerda ishlayman.

53
00:03:14,165 --> 00:03:18,809
Shundaymi, shu yaqinlarda ishlaysizmi?

54
00:03:18,832 --> 00:03:22,638
Ha. Ana u yerda, ofisda.

55
00:03:22,662 --> 00:03:28,064
Ajoyib! Hech oʻzgarmagansiz.

56
00:03:28,088 --> 00:03:32,854
Yoʻq, ozgina semirdim.

57
00:03:32,877 --> 00:03:37,011
Bunday emas.

58
00:03:37,034 --> 00:03:41,967
Hana-san, hozir nima bilan shugʻullanmoqdasiz?

59
00:03:41,990 --> 00:03:45,726
Men ingliz tili oʻqituvchisi boʻlib ishlayapman.

60
00:03:45,749 --> 00:03:49,720
Ingliz tili oʻqituvchisi?!

61
00:03:49,743 --> 00:03:52,176
Ajoyib!

62
00:03:52,199 --> 00:03:54,133
Rahmat.

63
00:03:54,156 --> 00:03:58,989
Har kuni band boʻlsam ham, juda qiziqarli.

64
00:03:59,012 --> 00:04:03,428
Bugun uchrashganimizdan chin qalbdan xursandman.

65
00:04:03,452 --> 00:04:09,052
Men ham juda hayratlandim va xursandman.

66
00:04:09,075 --> 00:04:12,608
Keyinroq vaqtiniz bormi?

67
00:04:12,631 --> 00:04:17,517
Ha, taxminan bir soat vaqtim bor.

68
00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:22,217
Unda, yaqin atrofdagi kafeda choy ichamizmi?

69
00:04:22,241 --> 00:04:25,443
Yaxshi, boramiz!

70
00:04:25,466 --> 00:04:29,433
Bu yerda mazali piroglar bor doʻkoni bor.

71
00:04:29,456 --> 00:04:32,625
Vaa, juda kutaman!

72
00:04:32,648 --> 00:04:35,882
Koʻp gaplashamiz, rozi?

73
00:04:35,905 --> 00:04:40,638
Ha, gaplashishni istaydigan koʻp narsalarim bor.

74
00:04:40,661 --> 00:04:43,833
Unda, boramiz!

75
00:04:43,856 --> 00:04:46,689
Ha, boramiz!

76
00:04:46,712 --> 00:04:52,865
Tushungan boʻlsangiz, izoh qoldiring.

77
00:04:52,865 --> 00:04:55,865
3-Sahna: Okinava sayohati uchun tayyorgarlik / Okinavaga sayohatga tayyorgarlik

78
00:04:55,865 --> 00:05:00,563
Ertadan Okinavaga sayohatimiz boshlanadi, shundaymi?

79
00:05:00,587 --> 00:05:04,393
Ha, rostdan ham juda hayajonlanmoqdaman!

80
00:05:04,416 --> 00:05:08,053
Yuklaringizni tayyorladingizmi?

81
00:05:08,077 --> 00:05:11,521
Yoʻq, hali tugatmadim.

82
00:05:11,544 --> 00:05:15,011
Tezroq tayyorlang, iltimos.

83
00:05:15,034 --> 00:05:18,110
Necha dona kiyim olib ketishim kerak?

84
00:05:18,133 --> 00:05:23,013
Okinava issiq joy, shuning uchun futbolkalar yaxshi boʻladi.

85
00:05:23,036 --> 00:05:24,836
Tushundim.

86
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:27,110
Koʻp olib ketaman.

87
00:05:27,133 --> 00:05:31,310
Dengizda suzishni juda kutmoqdaman.

88
00:05:31,333 --> 00:05:35,967
Ha, men ham toza dengizni koʻrishni xohlayapman.

89
00:05:35,990 --> 00:05:38,441
Kamerangizni olib keldingizmi?

90
00:05:38,464 --> 00:05:41,232
Albatta, olib keldim.

91
00:05:41,255 --> 00:05:44,272
Koʻp suratga tushamiz, rozi?

92
00:05:44,296 --> 00:05:48,663
Ha! Mazali taomlarning ham suratini olamiz.

93
00:05:48,686 --> 00:05:52,619
A, Okinava sobasini ham tatib koʻrmoqchiman.

94
00:05:52,642 --> 00:05:54,710
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

95
00:05:54,733 --> 00:05:57,103
Men ham tatib koʻrmoqchiman.

96
00:05:57,127 --> 00:06:00,093
Yoʻriqnoma qayerda?

97
00:06:00,116 --> 00:06:02,319
Bu yerda.

98
00:06:02,343 --> 00:06:05,545
Ertangi kechaga qayerga boramiz?

99
00:06:05,568 --> 00:06:08,785
Dengiz yaqinidagi restoran qanday?

100
00:06:08,809 --> 00:06:10,947
Juda yaxshi!

101
00:06:10,970 --> 00:06:13,174
Shu yerga boramiz.

102
00:06:13,198 --> 00:06:15,409
Ob-havo qanday boʻladi?

103
00:06:15,432 --> 00:06:17,883
Ertaga havo ochiq boʻladi.

104
00:06:17,906 --> 00:06:19,747
Yaxshi boʻldi!

105
00:06:19,770 --> 00:06:22,742
Eng ajoyib sayohat boʻladi, shunday emasmi?

106
00:06:22,766 --> 00:06:26,766
He-he, ha, bu kecha erta uxlashimiz kerak.

107
00:06:26,789 --> 00:06:30,995
Lekin shunchalik xursand edimki, uxlay olmayman.

108
00:06:31,018 --> 00:06:34,351
He-he, goʻdakdek boʻldingiz-ku.

109
00:06:34,374 --> 00:06:37,141
Rostdan ham.

110
00:06:37,164 --> 00:06:40,002
Lekin chin dildan hursandman.

111
00:06:40,025 --> 00:06:44,226
Kechikmaslik uchun budilnikni qoʻying.

112
00:06:44,250 --> 00:06:47,383
Ha, allaqachon qoʻyib qoʻydim.

113
00:06:47,406 --> 00:06:51,851
Yaxshi, ertaga erta turishimiz kerak, lekin baribir harakat qilaylik.

114
00:06:51,874 --> 00:06:54,909
Ha, yaxshi dam oling.

115
00:06:54,933 --> 00:06:57,933
4-Sahna: Hamyonni yoʻqotish holati / Hamyonni yoʻqotganda nima qilish kerak

116
00:06:57,933 --> 00:07:00,866
Voy, nima qilsam?

117
00:07:00,889 --> 00:07:03,556
Hamyonim yoʻq.

118
00:07:03,579 --> 00:07:05,459
Nima?

119
00:07:05,482 --> 00:07:07,849
Rostdanmi?

120
00:07:07,872 --> 00:07:11,117
Sumkani tekshirib koʻrdingizmi?

121
00:07:11,140 --> 00:07:16,607
Ha, hammasini tekshirdim, yoʻq.

122
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:20,563
Qayerda yoʻqotganingizni eslaysizmi?

123
00:07:20,586 --> 00:07:22,919
Bilmayman.

124
00:07:22,942 --> 00:07:26,809
Yaqinda xarid qilganimda bor edi.

125
00:07:26,832 --> 00:07:29,965
Politsiya postiga borib koʻraylik.

126
00:07:29,988 --> 00:07:34,887
Ichida pul ham, kartalar ham bor.

127
00:07:34,911 --> 00:07:37,044
Vaziyatni xotirjamlik bilan qabul qiling.

128
00:07:37,067 --> 00:07:39,647
Albatta, hammasi yaxshi boʻladi.

129
00:07:39,670 --> 00:07:43,270
Haqiqatan ham topib beradilarmi?

130
00:07:43,293 --> 00:07:48,293
Yapon politsiyasi juda mehribon, albatta topib berishadi.

131
00:07:48,317 --> 00:07:50,987
Ana u yerda politsiya posti bor.

132
00:07:51,010 --> 00:07:52,777
Boraylik.

133
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:57,214
Kechirasiz, yoʻqolgan hamyon haqida xabar bormi?

134
00:07:57,237 --> 00:08:00,638
Qora teridan qilingan hamyon.

135
00:08:00,662 --> 00:08:04,895
A, politsiyachi ichkariga ketdi.

136
00:08:04,918 --> 00:08:08,985
Yuragim dūp-dūp urmoqda.

137
00:08:09,008 --> 00:08:11,699
A, bir narsa olib keldi.

138
00:08:11,723 --> 00:08:15,456
Bu mening hamyonim!

139
00:08:15,479 --> 00:08:18,012
Rostdanmi?

140
00:08:18,035 --> 00:08:20,402
Yaxshi boʻldi.

141
00:08:20,426 --> 00:08:23,833
Ha, hech qanday shubha yoʻq.

142
00:08:23,857 --> 00:08:27,065
Ichidagi narsalarni tekshirib koʻring.

143
00:08:27,088 --> 00:08:30,755
Pul ham, kartalar ham hammasi joyida.

144
00:08:30,779 --> 00:08:33,755
Yaxshi boʻldi.

145
00:08:33,779 --> 00:08:36,870
Rostdan ham yengil nafas oldim.

146
00:08:36,893 --> 00:08:41,096
Ha, yuragimga tosh tushdi.

147
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:44,686
Topib bergan odamga minnatdorchilik bildirish kerak.

148
00:08:44,709 --> 00:08:50,276
Ha, mehribon odamga rahmat aytishni istayman.

149
00:08:50,299 --> 00:08:54,866
He-he, endi boshqa yoʻqotmang.

150
00:08:54,889 --> 00:08:59,228
He-he, ha, bundan keyin ehtiyot boʻlaman.

151
00:08:59,251 --> 00:09:03,710
Endi xotirjam boʻldim, qorni ochdi.

152
00:09:03,733 --> 00:09:09,106
Ha, men sizga mazali ovqat taklif qilaman.

153
00:09:09,130 --> 00:09:11,976
Rostdanmi, yaxshimi?

154
00:09:11,999 --> 00:09:13,966
Juda xursand boʻldim.

155
00:09:13,989 --> 00:09:18,794
Albatta, birga borishga rozi boʻlganingiz uchun rahmat.

156
00:09:18,817 --> 00:09:22,384
Arzimaydi. Boraylik.

157
00:09:22,407 --> 00:09:25,407
5-Sahna: Eng Yangi Smartfon Xususiyatlarining Taniishuvi

158
00:09:25,407 --> 00:09:30,541
Qarang, yangi smartfon sotib oldim.

159
00:09:30,564 --> 00:09:35,098
Vov, bu eng yangi model ekan-ku!

160
00:09:35,121 --> 00:09:39,728
Ha, kecha sotuvga chiqdi.

161
00:09:39,751 --> 00:09:44,406
Yaxshi ekan, juda havas qilaman.

162
00:09:44,430 --> 00:09:47,696
Ekrani juda chiroyli ekan.

163
00:09:47,719 --> 00:09:52,592
Rostdan ham. Harakati ham juda tez.

164
00:09:52,616 --> 00:09:56,290
Kamerasi ham ajoyib ekan.

165
00:09:56,313 --> 00:10:00,980
Mening smartfonim eski, havas qilaman.

166
00:10:01,003 --> 00:10:04,892
Rasmga tushirib koʻraylikmi?

167
00:10:04,916 --> 00:10:06,565
Ha, iltimos.

168
00:10:06,589 --> 00:10:10,022
Xop, cheese.

169
00:10:10,045 --> 00:10:15,078
Vay, mening terim juda chiroyli chiqibdi-ku!

170
00:10:15,102 --> 00:10:20,268
Hehe, qorongʻuda ham yorqin chiqadi.

171
00:10:20,291 --> 00:10:24,758
Yaxshi ekan, rostan ham xohlayapman.

172
00:10:24,781 --> 00:10:28,065
Narxi biroz qimmat edi.

173
00:10:28,088 --> 00:10:30,259
Qancha boʻldi?

174
00:10:30,282 --> 00:10:32,923
150 ming yen boʻldi.

175
00:10:32,947 --> 00:10:37,180
Yuz ellik ming yenmi? Qimmat ekan-ku.

176
00:10:37,203 --> 00:10:43,236
Lekin har kuni ishlataman-ku.

177
00:10:43,259 --> 00:10:46,259
Men yana ikki yil hozirgi smartfonimni ishlataman.

178
00:10:46,282 --> 00:10:50,449
Buzilguncha ishlatamiz.

179
00:10:50,472 --> 00:10:55,251
Lekin sizning smartfoningizni koʻrgach, xohlay boshladim.

180
00:10:55,275 --> 00:10:58,875
Keyingi oy bonus bilan sotib olmaysizmi?

181
00:10:58,898 --> 00:11:03,075
Bonusni sayohatga sarflashni rejalashtirgan edim.

182
00:11:03,099 --> 00:11:08,232
Unda sayohat paytida mening smartfonim bilan koʻp suratga tushamiz.

183
00:11:08,255 --> 00:11:11,230
Bu yaxshi fikr ekan.

184
00:11:11,253 --> 00:11:16,053
Koʻp chiroyli rasmlarni sovgʻa qilaman.

185
00:11:16,076 --> 00:11:17,774
Rahmat.

186
00:11:17,798 --> 00:11:19,808
Kutgandayman.

187
00:11:19,832 --> 00:11:23,521
Lekin rostan ham qulay ekan.

188
00:11:23,544 --> 00:11:27,833
A, baribir biroz havas qilaman.

189
00:11:27,856 --> 00:11:32,471
Bunday demang, hozir kafeda sinab koʻring.

190
00:11:32,495 --> 00:11:36,136
Yaxshimi? Tegib koʻrmoqchiman.

191
00:11:36,159 --> 00:11:38,559
Ha, marhamat.

192
00:11:38,583 --> 00:11:42,316
Rahmat. Rostdan ham xursandman.

193
00:11:42,339 --> 00:11:45,339
6-Sahna: Imtihon Natijalarini E’lon Qilish Lahzasi

194
00:11:45,339 --> 00:11:50,375
A, imtihon natijalari sayti ochildi.

195
00:11:50,399 --> 00:11:52,537
Rostdanmi?

196
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:55,173
Juda ham asabim buzilmoqda.

197
00:11:55,197 --> 00:11:58,764
Mening raqamimni qidiring.

198
00:11:58,787 --> 00:12:03,396
Raqamingiz nechanchi?

199
00:12:03,419 --> 00:12:06,673
10045.

200
00:12:06,696 --> 00:12:08,395
Bormi?

201
00:12:08,419 --> 00:12:11,110
Bor ekan.

202
00:12:11,133 --> 00:12:12,867
Shu yerda.

203
00:12:12,890 --> 00:12:15,423
Ha, rostdanmi?

204
00:12:15,446 --> 00:12:17,303
Rostdanmi?

205
00:12:17,326 --> 00:12:21,060
Ha, 10045 raqam.

206
00:12:21,083 --> 00:12:23,616
Tabriklayman, muvaffaqiyatli topshirdingiz!

207
00:12:23,639 --> 00:12:28,075
Yoo! Juda xursandman!

208
00:12:28,098 --> 00:12:29,948
Ishonolmayapman.

209
00:12:29,972 --> 00:12:32,944
Haqiqatan ham zoʻr boʻldi-ku.

210
00:12:32,968 --> 00:12:37,001
Har kuni koʻp oʻqir edingiz-ku.

211
00:12:37,024 --> 00:12:41,433
Ha, har kecha kechgacha mehnat qildim.

212
00:12:41,456 --> 00:12:44,894
Bugun kechasi nishonlaymiz!

213
00:12:44,917 --> 00:12:46,752
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

214
00:12:46,775 --> 00:12:49,842
Mazali narsa yeyishga boring.

215
00:12:49,865 --> 00:12:52,198
Nima yeyishni xohlaysiz?

216
00:12:52,221 --> 00:12:55,188
Men sushini xohlayman.

217
00:12:55,211 --> 00:12:57,820
Qimmat sushi ham boʻladimi?

218
00:12:57,843 --> 00:13:00,735
Albatta, boʻladi-ku!

219
00:13:00,759 --> 00:13:03,925
Bugun men toʻlayman.

220
00:13:03,948 --> 00:13:06,915
Ha, rostan ham yaxshimi?

221
00:13:06,938 --> 00:13:08,706
Rahmat.

222
00:13:08,729 --> 00:13:12,263
Bu sizning mehnatingizni nishonlash.

223
00:13:12,286 --> 00:13:14,452
Juda xursand boʻldim.

224
00:13:14,475 --> 00:13:18,875
A, sizning raqamingiz bor edi-ku?

225
00:13:18,898 --> 00:13:21,565
A, unutib qoʻygan ekanman.

226
00:13:21,589 --> 00:13:26,222
Mening raqamim 10050.

227
00:13:26,245 --> 00:13:28,978
Kuting, iltimos.

228
00:13:29,001 --> 00:13:30,835
Hozir qidiryapman.

229
00:13:30,857 --> 00:13:32,391
Qanday?

230
00:13:32,414 --> 00:13:33,947
Bormi?

231
00:13:33,970 --> 00:13:42,403
Eee, 10048, 10049, a, topdim!

232
00:13:42,426 --> 00:13:45,393
10050 raqami.

233
00:13:45,416 --> 00:13:48,483
Ha, rostan ham topdingizmi?

234
00:13:48,506 --> 00:13:52,120
Ha, siz ham muvaffaqiyatli boʻldingiz.

235
00:13:52,143 --> 00:13:54,110
Tabriklayman!

236
00:13:54,133 --> 00:13:56,100
Qilgandik!

237
00:13:56,123 --> 00:13:58,556
Men ham muvaffaqiyatli boʻldim.

238
00:13:58,579 --> 00:14:01,312
Ajoyib!

239
00:14:01,335 --> 00:14:05,349
Ikki oʻzimiz ham muvaffaqiyatli boʻlib, juda xursandman.

240
00:14:05,373 --> 00:14:06,982
Shunday.

241
00:14:07,006 --> 00:14:09,439
Eng zoʻr kayfiyatda.

242
00:14:09,462 --> 00:14:14,462
Endi shu mazali sushi doʻkonini band qilamiz.

243
00:14:14,485 --> 00:14:17,958
Ha, hozir qoʻngʻiroq qilaman.

244
00:14:17,981 --> 00:14:20,981
7-SAHNA: Konsert chiptasini qoʻldan boy berganlikning afsuslanishi

245
00:14:20,981 --> 00:14:25,581
Konsert chiptasi natijasi keldi.

246
00:14:25,604 --> 00:14:27,404
Qanday boʻldi?

247
00:14:27,427 --> 00:14:29,404
Yuttingizmi?

248
00:14:29,428 --> 00:14:32,325
Yoʻq, yutmadi.

249
00:14:32,349 --> 00:14:34,282
Qaytib ketti.

250
00:14:34,305 --> 00:14:38,505
Vay, juda afsus.

251
00:14:38,528 --> 00:14:40,227
Ha.

252
00:14:40,250 --> 00:14:44,817
Juda kutgandim, shuning uchun juda afsuslandim.

253
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:47,685
Men ham afsuslandim.

254
00:14:47,709 --> 00:14:52,109
Yangi qoʻshiqlarni koʻp mashq qildim-ku.

255
00:14:52,132 --> 00:14:54,227
Shunday.

256
00:14:54,250 --> 00:14:57,017
Har kuni tinglar edim.

257
00:14:57,040 --> 00:15:01,073
Nega yutmagan boʻlamiz?

258
00:15:01,096 --> 00:15:05,794
Bu guruh juda mashhur-ku.

259
00:15:05,818 --> 00:15:09,691
Chipta olish juda qiyin.

260
00:15:09,714 --> 00:15:15,133
Tashlab yubormoqchi emasman, lekin boshqa chipta yoʻq.

261
00:15:15,156 --> 00:15:18,037
Boshqa kunlar konserti qanday?

262
00:15:18,061 --> 00:15:23,228
Boshqa kunlarda ish bor, borolmayman.

263
00:15:23,251 --> 00:15:25,217
Shunday ekan.

264
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:28,574
Bu juda afsuski.

265
00:15:28,597 --> 00:15:33,830
Aa, bugun hech narsa qilishga istamayapman.

266
00:15:33,853 --> 00:15:35,820
Jasorat oling!

267
00:15:35,843 --> 00:15:41,176
Lekin, kutgan rejalari bekor boʻlib qoldi.

268
00:15:41,199 --> 00:15:46,081
Unda, bugun oqshom karaokega boramizmi?

269
00:15:46,105 --> 00:15:48,350
Karaokemı?

270
00:15:48,373 --> 00:15:50,024
Ha.

271
00:15:50,047 --> 00:15:53,681
Bu guruhning koʻp qoʻshiqlarini aytamiz.

272
00:15:53,704 --> 00:15:56,674
Bu yaxshi fikr ekan.

273
00:15:56,698 --> 00:16:00,065
Mazzali narsalarni ham koʻp yeymiz.

274
00:16:00,088 --> 00:16:01,821
Rahmat.

275
00:16:01,844 --> 00:16:04,677
Biroz ruhiyatim koʻtarildi.

276
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:08,434
Bekat yaqinidagi karaoke joyi qanday?

277
00:16:08,457 --> 00:16:11,990
U yerda xonalar keng va yaxshi ekan.

278
00:16:12,013 --> 00:16:15,313
Unda, hozir band qilaman.

279
00:16:15,336 --> 00:16:17,213
Ha, iltimos.

280
00:16:17,237 --> 00:16:21,870
Koʻp qoʻshiq aytib, afsuslanish hisini unutamiz.

281
00:16:21,893 --> 00:16:23,427
Shunday.

282
00:16:23,449 --> 00:16:25,853
Qattiq kuylayman.

283
00:16:25,877 --> 00:16:27,976
Yaxshi.

284
00:16:27,999 --> 00:16:30,966
Unda, bekatda uchrashamiz.

285
00:16:30,989 --> 00:16:32,428
Ha.

286
00:16:32,452 --> 00:16:34,819
Keyinroq koʻrishamiz.

287
00:16:34,841 --> 00:16:37,841
Sahna 8: Intervyu oldidan asabiylikni yengillashtirish

288
00:16:37,841 --> 00:16:40,975
Voy, nima qilsam?

289
00:16:40,998 --> 00:16:44,372
Juda asabiyman.

290
00:16:44,395 --> 00:16:46,834
Hech qisi yo‘q.

291
00:16:46,858 --> 00:16:48,940
Vaziyatni xotirjamlik bilan qabul qiling.

292
00:16:48,963 --> 00:16:52,730
Qo‘lim biroz qaltiryapti.

293
00:16:52,753 --> 00:16:56,167
Chuqur nafas oling.

294
00:16:56,190 --> 00:17:02,272
Nafas oling... chiqarig.

295
00:17:02,295 --> 00:17:07,368
Suuu... haaa.

296
00:17:07,392 --> 00:17:09,792
Bir oz yaxshiroq boʻldi.

297
00:17:09,815 --> 00:17:13,651
Intervyu soati nechada boshlanadi?

298
00:17:13,674 --> 00:17:17,674
Yana oʻn besh daqiqa qoldi.

299
00:17:17,697 --> 00:17:20,897
Hali vaqt bor-ku.

300
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:25,720
Savollarga yaxshi javob bera olishimdan xavotirdaman.

301
00:17:25,743 --> 00:17:29,435
Biroz birga mashq qilamizmi?

302
00:17:29,459 --> 00:17:31,869
Ha, iltimos.

303
00:17:31,893 --> 00:17:35,426
Nega aynan bu do‘konda ishlashni xohlaysiz?

304
00:17:35,449 --> 00:17:40,849
Chunki bu do‘konning kofesi va pirogi juda yoqadi.

305
00:17:40,872 --> 00:17:43,124
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

306
00:17:43,148 --> 00:17:47,953
Do‘kon xodimlari ham mehribon, bu yaxshi.

307
00:17:47,976 --> 00:17:49,910
Shunday.

308
00:17:49,933 --> 00:17:54,799
Xodimlar har doim tabassum qiladilar.

309
00:17:54,822 --> 00:17:58,227
Ajoyib javob!

310
00:17:58,250 --> 00:18:00,817
Ishonchli boʻling.

311
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:02,573
Rahmat.

312
00:18:02,596 --> 00:18:06,996
Haftada necha kun ishlashingiz mumkin?

313
00:18:07,019 --> 00:18:10,653
Uch kun ishlay olaman.

314
00:18:10,676 --> 00:18:14,163
Shanba va yakshanba kunlari ham boʻladi.

315
00:18:14,186 --> 00:18:19,753
Unda do‘kon xodimlari xursand boʻlishadi.

316
00:18:19,776 --> 00:18:22,109
Rostdanmi?

317
00:18:22,132 --> 00:18:27,999
Ha, shanba va yakshanba kunlari ishlay oladigan odamlar juda muhim.

318
00:18:28,022 --> 00:18:31,222
Bir oz tinchlandim.

319
00:18:31,245 --> 00:18:35,081
Siz albatta yaxshi boʻlasiz.

320
00:18:35,104 --> 00:18:39,183
Siz bilan birga kelganingiz yaxshi boʻldi.

321
00:18:39,206 --> 00:18:43,140
Doʻstlarimiz, albatta.

322
00:18:43,163 --> 00:18:46,563
Ha. Harakat qilaman.

323
00:18:46,586 --> 00:18:51,989
Intervyu tugagach, shu yerda kutib turaman.

324
00:18:52,013 --> 00:18:54,981
Ha. Tugagach, xabar beraman.

325
00:18:55,004 --> 00:18:57,222
Xayr, ketib keling!

326
00:18:57,246 --> 00:18:59,337
Sizni qoʻllab-quvvatlayapman.

327
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:02,975
Ketib kelaman.

328
00:19:02,999 --> 00:19:05,999
Sahna 9: Futbolkani teskari kiyganini payqash / Futbolkani teskari kiyib olganini sezish

329
00:19:05,999 --> 00:19:10,080
Bugungi kafe juda tinch va yaxshi ekan, shunday emasmi?

330
00:19:10,103 --> 00:19:11,970
Shunday.

331
00:19:11,993 --> 00:19:15,050
Qahva ham juda mazali.

332
00:19:15,073 --> 00:19:20,673
A, ana, biroz aytish qiyin boʻlsa ham...

333
00:19:20,696 --> 00:19:22,229
Nima?

334
00:19:22,252 --> 00:19:24,485
Nima boʻldi?

335
00:19:24,508 --> 00:19:29,708
Sizning futbolkangiz, balki teskari kiyilgan boʻlmasin?

336
00:19:29,731 --> 00:19:31,430
E?

337
00:19:31,454 --> 00:19:33,587
Nima?

338
00:19:33,610 --> 00:19:36,943
Oldi va orqasi teskari kiyilgan.

339
00:19:36,966 --> 00:19:39,009
Yorliq koʻrinib turibdi.

340
00:19:39,033 --> 00:19:42,366
Aaa, rostmi?

341
00:19:42,389 --> 00:19:44,356
Rostdanmi?

342
00:19:44,379 --> 00:19:45,512
Ha.

343
00:19:45,535 --> 00:19:50,335
Boʻyingizning orqasida boʻlishi kerak boʻlgan yorliq oldingizda turibdi.

344
00:19:50,358 --> 00:19:54,217
Voy, rost ekan. Uyat boʻladi-ku.

345
00:19:54,241 --> 00:19:56,207
Xe-xe-xe.

346
00:19:56,230 --> 00:19:58,831
Qachondan beri teskari kiyib yurgan edingiz?

347
00:19:58,854 --> 00:20:03,033
Ertadan beri shu holatda edim.

348
00:20:03,057 --> 00:20:05,535
Poyezdda ham ketdingiz-ku.

349
00:20:05,558 --> 00:20:07,391
Ha.

350
00:20:07,414 --> 00:20:10,153
Toʻla poyezdda ham bordim.

351
00:20:10,176 --> 00:20:13,343
Doʻkonga ham borgan edingiz-ku.

352
00:20:13,366 --> 00:20:15,138
Ha.

353
00:20:15,161 --> 00:20:18,161
Sotuvchi bilan gaplashdim ham.

354
00:20:18,184 --> 00:20:22,022
Hech kim aytib bermadi-ku.

355
00:20:22,046 --> 00:20:26,779
Aaa, shuning uchun hamma menga qarab turardi.

356
00:20:26,802 --> 00:20:28,935
Xe-xe-xe.

357
00:20:28,958 --> 00:20:31,125
Uyat boʻladi-ku.

358
00:20:31,148 --> 00:20:35,194
Yuzim qizib ketdi.

359
00:20:35,217 --> 00:20:39,475
Tezroq hojatxonaga borib, tuzatib olsangiz yaxshi boʻlardi.

360
00:20:39,499 --> 00:20:41,143
Ha.

361
00:20:41,166 --> 00:20:43,099
Hozir borib kelaman.

362
00:20:43,122 --> 00:20:46,656
Sumkani shu yerda qoldirib ketishingiz mumkin.

363
00:20:46,679 --> 00:20:48,445
Men kuzatib turaman.

364
00:20:48,468 --> 00:20:50,083
Rahmat.

365
00:20:50,107 --> 00:20:52,440
Yugurib borib kelaman.

366
00:20:52,463 --> 00:20:55,348
Ehtiyot boʻling.

367
00:20:55,371 --> 00:20:59,385
Haqiqatan ham uyat boʻlgan kun.

368
00:20:59,409 --> 00:21:01,942
Hech qisi yo‘q.

369
00:21:01,965 --> 00:21:04,639
Hech kim buni sezmaydi.

370
00:21:04,663 --> 00:21:07,533
Shunday boʻlsa yaxshi.

371
00:21:07,556 --> 00:21:11,690
Tezroq boring, yengil tortib qayting.

372
00:21:11,712 --> 00:21:13,487
Ha.

373
00:21:13,511 --> 00:21:15,401
Tez orada qaytaman.

374
00:21:15,425 --> 00:21:17,558
Xe-xe-xe.

375
00:21:17,581 --> 00:21:20,314
Shoshilmang, yaxshi boring.

376
00:21:20,337 --> 00:21:23,337
Sahna 10: Kechikkanlik uchun uzr soʻrash / Kechikkanlik uchun uzr soʻrash usuli

377
00:21:23,337 --> 00:21:26,304
Juda kechikdingiz-ku.

378
00:21:26,327 --> 00:21:30,127
Uch soatdan beri kutib turibman.

379
00:21:30,150 --> 00:21:34,083
Kechirasiz, kechikib qoldim.

380
00:21:34,106 --> 00:21:37,706
Nega xabar bermadingiz?

381
00:21:37,729 --> 00:21:42,199
Telefonimning batareyasi tugab qoldi.

382
00:21:42,223 --> 00:21:47,389
Batareya tugasa ham, jamoat telefoni orqali xabar berishingiz mumkin edi-ku.

383
00:21:47,412 --> 00:21:52,146
Kechirasiz, shuni oʻylab ham koʻrmadim.

384
00:21:52,169 --> 00:21:56,902
Men bu yerda doimo tashvishlanib turdim.

385
00:21:56,925 --> 00:22:00,860
Rostdan ham uzr.

386
00:22:00,883 --> 00:22:03,979
Siz har doim kechikib kelasiz-ku.

387
00:22:04,002 --> 00:22:06,493
O'tgan haftada ham shunday edi.

388
00:22:06,517 --> 00:22:10,756
Ha, doim haqiqatan uzr so'rayman.

389
00:22:10,780 --> 00:22:15,648
Vaqtga rioya qilish juda muhim.

390
00:22:15,671 --> 00:22:18,838
Ha, tushunarli.

391
00:22:18,861 --> 00:22:23,094
Siz mening vaqtimni qadrlamaysiz deb o'ylayman.

392
00:22:23,117 --> 00:22:26,084
Bunday emas.

393
00:22:26,107 --> 00:22:28,960
Haqiqatan pushaymonman.

394
00:22:28,983 --> 00:22:34,723
Bugun tomosha qilishni intiqlik bilan kutgan filmim allaqachon boshlanib ketdi.

395
00:22:34,746 --> 00:22:35,913
E?

396
00:22:35,936 --> 00:22:38,184
Rostdanmi?

397
00:22:38,208 --> 00:22:42,808
Ha, dastlabki o'n besh daqiqasini ko'ra olmadim.

398
00:22:42,831 --> 00:22:46,901
Ah, bu haqiqatan ham uzr.

399
00:22:46,924 --> 00:22:50,059
Nega doimo kechikib kelasiz?

400
00:22:50,083 --> 00:22:54,771
Ertalab turishim kechikib ketdi.

401
00:22:54,795 --> 00:22:58,528
Ko'proq budilnik qo'ying.

402
00:22:58,551 --> 00:23:01,985
Ha, bugundan boshlab shunday qilaman.

403
00:23:02,009 --> 00:23:07,009
Jahl chiqarmoqchi emasman, lekin haqiqatan ham xafa bo'ldim.

404
00:23:07,032 --> 00:23:09,504
Iltimos, menga kechiring.

405
00:23:09,527 --> 00:23:12,897
Keyingi chiptani men sotib olaman.

406
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:15,977
Bu pul masalasi emas.

407
00:23:16,001 --> 00:23:20,018
Ha, his-tuyg'u masalasi ekan.

408
00:23:20,041 --> 00:23:24,246
Keyinroq hech qachon kechikmang.

409
00:23:24,269 --> 00:23:27,203
Ha, va'da beraman.

410
00:23:27,226 --> 00:23:29,592
Hech qachon kechikmayman.

411
00:23:29,615 --> 00:23:31,649
Tushundim.

412
00:23:31,672 --> 00:23:34,105
Bu safar kechiraman.

413
00:23:34,128 --> 00:23:36,132
Rahmat.

414
00:23:36,155 --> 00:23:38,922
Tezroq kinoteatrga boring.

415
00:23:38,945 --> 00:23:41,911
Ha, shoshilaylik.